## AI keyword screen

Match rule: case-insensitive whole words; a term ending in * matches word starts; every other term also matches with an appended s or es; a space or hyphen in a term matches a space or a hyphen in the text. Fields: title, summary, notes.

63 terms: `LLM`, `large language model`, `generative AI`, `GPT`, `ChatGPT`, `OpenAI`, `Claude`, `Anthropic`, `Gemini`, `Copilot`, `Llama`, `Mistral`, `DeepSeek`, `chatbot`, `AI assistant`, `AI agent`, `agentic`, `autonomous agent`, `MCP`, `Model Context Protocol`, `prompt injection`, `jailbreak`, `RAG`, `vector database`, `embedding`, `coding assistant`, `Cursor`, `Windsurf`, `Claude Code`, `Codex`, `Gemini CLI`, `LangChain`, `Langflow`, `LlamaIndex`, `Ollama`, `vLLM`, `LiteLLM`, `Hugging Face`, `model weights`, `fine-tun*`, `AI-generated`, `vibe cod*`, `LLMjacking`, `deepfake`, `AI`, `artificial intelligence`, `machine learning`, `facial recognition`, `voice clon*`, `multi-agent`, `Grok`, `xAI`, `OpenClaw`, `ClawHub`, `NotebookLM`, `XBOW`, `Lovable`, `Base44`, `Replit`, `robot*`, `self-driving`, `driverless`, `autonomous vehicle`.

